sertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於辰日天變，巳日大雨"}, {"anon_id": "P3-7f4ce6e5", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后果然（儿妇妊性别如断），澹宁壬午春死。当年脱险、儿妇生男生女、壬午春卒三项均见原文应验记载。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-80587e40", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Trump won the Electoral College on 8 November 2016 in a close election. On 28 October 2016 FBI Director Comey's letter reopening the Clinton email matter became public, dominating the final campaign week. Trump was not assassinated and completed his term."}, {"anon_id": "P3-80783f86", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实：俞鸿钧官至行政院长、上海市长、中央银行总裁；1960年卒"}, {"anon_id": "P3-80d11241", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实：俞大维官至国防部长、交通部长，为技术官僚重臣；1983年卒于台北（后移灵大陆）"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8131c81e", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Confirmed in the text: 'My counsel was followed, and the issue was thus: By the Gentleman's means and procurement, the matter was brought on again, the Match effected, and all within twenty days following, to the content of the sorrowful (but as to me unthankful) Lady.'"}, {"anon_id": "P3-81f12572", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果得於甲午日。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-83613ec0", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后此人往返三次俱得倍利．"}, {"anon_id": "P3-83d348c8", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "当日见标。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-84c590c2", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果于申予日归"}, {"anon_id": "P3-84caaedd", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果至青州遇兵不能进；及至京授天津屯田巡抚；李自成破京后遂归里；其母于乙酉年（1645）寿终，年81虚岁。应验段独立载于原文。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-84d935c7", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於本日酉時遇名醫救活也，至己亥日以全生。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-84fcb47f", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於戌日申時雨"}, {"anon_id": "P3-87223107", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "此人去买，菉豆地头缺少，改买棉花，果亏折"}, {"anon_id": "P3-87390f91", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Confirmed in the text: a gentleman of the querent's acquaintance, coming by accident to see a friend in Long Acre, found the dog tied up under a table, knew it to be the querent's, and sent it home that same Monday about ten in the morning — 'to my very great credit.'"}, {"anon_id": "P3-873a48e4", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "至次日申时方产。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8748516c", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "本岁不得，至来春正月，就地于南山。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-87496a50", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於丑日起牀。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-877c2e42", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Confirmed in detail in the text: the bargain was struck on 25 April following (the day Venus and the Sun came to their aspect); on 17 May he paid the £530 and his conveyance was sealed — 'six weeks and some days from the time of the Question'; a friend lent him £500 twelve days after (when Mercury turned direct). Lilly adds he did himself injury in money by the bargain but never repented it."}, {"anon_id": "P3-88820e4e", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "辉瑞/BioNTech疫苗2020年12月2日获英国批准、12月8日开始接种，其后全球接种逾百亿剂次；病毒后来确实转为地方性流行，「共存」部分成真，但「没有疫苗」的字面预测在发表后六周即被证伪"}, {"anon_id": "P3-890ad7ae", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果至其日而死，此應出旬又被沖克也．"}, {"anon_id": "P3-89d968d3", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "缪斌抗战时投汪伪，战后被捕；其妻请同乡吴稚晖向蒋介石说情，吴奔走过力反启蒋疑，国民政府下令将缪斌枪决（1946年），应了「受累于吴」"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8b533add", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后擢齐地分野。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8b6bb8aa", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Confirmed in the text: 'I judged that she would find him there at her coming home: which she did'; and of the trine day, 'therefore I judged that she should see him at that time: which she did.' The 1647 further explanation adds she reached home about 3 p.m. that day and found her son abiding her coming."}, {"anon_id": "P3-8b7a747d", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於三月升任云南太守，卽升者乃因爻得水局生扶，應三月者辰土出空之月也，應云南者，世與官星皆在六爻之故耳。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8c1c7610", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "特朗普以明确优势胜出"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8c45275a", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后于乙亥日卒"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8ca8fcdc", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後此人屢次遇兵變﹐或避之﹐或有驚無險﹐"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8d3affe4", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於本月聞由江西升任山東，未及一載，復任江西"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8d4b4344", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "畢萬後受晉獻公賜魏地、為大夫，其子孫以魏為氏，蕃昌，終為戰國七雄之一的魏國（《左傳》閔公元年卜偃亦曰「畢萬之後必大」）"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8e75003d", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於二月得意而回。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8e867e90", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "On speaking with the patient the symptoms were found exactly as judged: great pain and rumbling in his head, a very dry cough, great weakness and pain in his breast and at the heart, complexion as if inclined to the jaundice, a lingering consumption, red gravel and difficulty in making urine; 'He dyed the fourteenth of August following.'"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8ee3f98f", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於次日卯時生，母子平安，應卯時者，酉金與辰日相合。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8ef37c53", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "及子寅年连生二男，岂非盛德格天之报。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8f95ab4d", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於次日卯時，雲開日出"}, {"anon_id": "P3-8fdc22eb", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果然如是。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-902e3fea", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Barack Obama defeated Mitt Romney on 6 November 2012 (332 electoral votes to 206) and began a second term."}, {"anon_id": "P3-910a54ed", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实：于右任官至监察院院长（任职31年），书法宗师，一生以公务与文字劳碌著称；1964年卒于台北——与韦断相合"}, {"anon_id": "P3-91359de5", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後二十日，人果買此牛，殺以犒眾"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9138fd8e", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Confirmed in the text: Lilly took out a warrant, kept it private until Sunday 18th, searched only that one house, and 'found part of my fish in water, part eaten, part not consumed; all confessed' — including seven Portugal onions the thief's wife had unknowingly made into pottage."}, {"anon_id": "P3-91812bc3", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "次日乙卯，冲实用神，是辰乃至。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-91953f7e", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "'This advice was followed, the course of Physick altered, and the afflicted party in or about three weeks perfectly recovered.'"}, {"anon_id": "P3-92212d44", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於次日大愈"}, {"anon_id": "P3-925c1e01", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於本日愈。覺子曰﹕如占自身及兄弟妻兒者﹐此法是也﹐若占父母之災﹐官鬼爲父母之元神﹐豈宜子動而傷耶﹖妻占夫宜鬼爲用神﹐又豈子動以傷官耶﹖不惟不能解憂反添優也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-926051f6", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "丙子日得也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-92a2d024", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於子時退災﹐次日起牀﹐"}, {"anon_id": "P3-935bc671", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "'He was beheaded about the tenth of January following.'"}, {"anon_id": "P3-93aa4743", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后于午月覆舟而亡．"}, {"anon_id": "P3-944ec8f3", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於本月聞報升山東，未及一載復任江西，應本月升者卯官而值月令升山東者，官臨卯木，復任江西者，外卦反伏，去之而復反也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-945e5e81", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "以后果无事（父病无事）。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-94d49ba0", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果五日，此老赴席，因魚骨鯁而終"}, {"anon_id": "P3-954d0b6c", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果得財﹐應辰日者﹐世動逢合之日也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-972e373b", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "开钟视之，乃玉绦环，果已破损——物类（玉环，贵重）、形状（圆）、状态（破）、色泽（白）与断语逐项相合。应验段在原文中独立成句（「开视，乃玉绦环，果破矣」），与断语可分离。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-985ffbd3", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "后至午月子水逄月破，其子病故，即辞师矣．"}, {"anon_id": "P3-98929186", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "此子未年而死。 夫應七月傷妻﹐卯木財爻絕於申也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9ae761db", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果於本日酉時，得名醫救活，亥日痊愈"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9b329bd0", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果死於午日午時，此謂伏無提拔也．"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9b7a52c0", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实：哈同（Silas Hardoon）白手起家成为上海地产大王；终身无亲生子女，靠收养义子义女，死后遗产诉讼满城风雨——与韦断相合；1931年卒于上海"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9d07b1f9", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实：张学良1934年（甲戌年）归国重掌兵权；1936年12月（丙子年）西安事变后被长期软禁，政治上「陷于不复之地」与韦断相合；2001年卒于夏威夷，享寿百岁（寿元非韦断重点）"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9d0de1f1", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Confirmed in the text: 'The event proved me right, both as to the person and the return of the money, which was within three days after' — although the querent at first 'believed not one word I said.'"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9d33280f", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "卽於壬寅日得差﹐次年三月死於中途﹐"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9d3405cc", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果卒於卯年﹐乃應戌土逢合之年而克世也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9d488bb6", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後果買馬七十餘匹﹐一路多死﹐僅存二十八匹﹐幸而得價不然大虧其本。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9dad1883", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "後屢見逢顯貴聘之﹐才高气傲﹐皆不待瓜期辭矣。目摯十餘載﹐貧寒淡泊﹐後隨表弟升任云南﹐不知所終。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9dc5d42a", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "但此人功名之念切甚﹐讀書苦勝囊螢﹐文章當時竟未遊泮﹐後從戌二十餘載﹐或立軍功﹐或援例納粟﹐奔馳於名利之場﹐皓首無成﹐此子孫克官之徵驗也。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9e8090dc", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "史实：段祺瑞三任国务总理、1924-1926任临时执政（韦书成于1963年，「未执政」一语与史实不合，疑指其执政不稳/未久安，或版本文字之异——本数据集如实标为已知偏差点）；1918-1920确为其权势黄金期，与韦断三年相合；1936年卒"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9efbd09d", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "果寅日到平子门外，雪中遇雪贼，劫银四十两。到日（寅日）、遇贼、劫银数（四十两）均载原文应验段。"}, {"anon_id": "P3-9fcaf702", "prediction": {"direction": null, "assertions": null, "timing": null, "summary": null}, "outcome_record": "Confirmed in the text: 'The Town was delivered for the Parliament's use the 27th of April... three days after the time limited by me was expired; but the very Monday before, being eight days after the Figure set, they began to treat.' Lilly adds the King's relief was beaten back at Caversham Bridge, the Governor (Aston) was hurt in the head (as Saturn in Pisces(?) afflicted by Mar